      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXIII} Gif mones ceorles mennen to nedhæmde geðreatað, mid V scill gebete þam ceorle; ⁊ LX schill to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone rapes a ceorl’s slave, let him recompense the ceorl with 5 shillings, and 60 shillings as fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone rapes the slave of a commoner, he shall pay 5 shillings to the commoner, and a fine of 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXVI. Gif mones ciorles mennen to nydhæmede mon geþreatað, mid V scll' gebete ðæm ciorle and LX scll' to wite.</ab>
      </div>
